WEBVTT

00:07.000 --> 00:12.500
Ask questions about your database
in plain English.

00:12.500 --> 00:21.000
DBWhisper retrieves schema context,
validates generated SQL, and returns results.

00:21.000 --> 00:28.000
On screen: older accuracy and fail-closed
scores. DBWhisper's audit retired both.

00:28.000 --> 00:31.500
Spider dev sample: the generation model
alone, with no retrieval or policy layer.

00:31.500 --> 00:35.000
101/139 matched the gold result set;
9 of 148 dropped after throttling.

00:35.000 --> 00:41.000
Editable SQL, charts, follow-ups,
and PostgreSQL, MySQL, or SQL Server.

00:41.000 --> 00:48.000
Retrieve relevant tables, generate SQL,
check read-only rules, then execute.

00:48.000 --> 00:53.000
Six-provider routing; responses depend
on available credentials and quota.

00:53.000 --> 00:58.000
SELECT-only checks and configured
read-only database permissions.

00:58.000 --> 01:01.400
Source code and deployment links
are in the case study.
